<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Interpore upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Interpore upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wasserstein Perella Securities said analyst Bob Dunne upgraded Interpore International Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- raised 1997 estimate to $0.33 from $0.27 and boosted 1998 to $0.42 from $0.35.</p>
<p>-- shares were flat at 4-7/8.</p>
</text>
